WEBVTT

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:37.972
Middle schoolers who have
lost the singles matches,

00:01:37.972 --> 00:01:41.434
please return to the dorms
to collect your belongings.

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:45.522
Your bus home is waiting for
you in the parking lot.

00:01:45.522 --> 00:01:47.774
That will be all. Good work.

00:01:49.025 --> 00:01:53.196
I can't believe they're
sending us home on a bus.

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:56.991
I wonder where Kintaro-<i>san </i>ran off to.

00:01:57.701 --> 00:01:59.327
Hey, hurry up.

00:01:59.828 --> 00:02:02.539
Kei-<i>kun</i>, your butt's stuck.

00:02:02.539 --> 00:02:04.207
This damn door...

00:02:12.382 --> 00:02:14.134
See you later, Eiji.

00:02:24.436 --> 00:02:25.937
It's up to you now.

00:02:44.414 --> 00:02:50.420
"Cliffs of the Heart"

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:53.882
They're actually leaving.

00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:57.844
The midget never showed up either.

00:02:57.844 --> 00:03:00.221
The 25 middle school winners are to

00:03:00.221 --> 00:03:02.599
gather on the main court immediately.

00:03:03.641 --> 00:03:05.435
"27. Spine
(4 Types x 30 Reps)"

00:03:05.435 --> 00:03:07.479
"27. Spine
(4 Types x 30 Reps)"
This is our practice regimen?

00:03:07.479 --> 00:03:09.814
"28. Toe Raise"
We're supposed to do all
of this starting tomorrow?

00:03:09.814 --> 00:03:11.566
"33. Elbow Pull"
Who said we're starting tomorrow?

00:03:11.733 --> 00:03:14.402
What? You mean we're starting now?

00:03:14.944 --> 00:03:17.155
You have six hours to
complete the workout.

00:03:17.155 --> 00:03:18.823
I don't want to hear any complaints.

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:22.327
The high schoolers can finish
this in three hours,

00:03:22.327 --> 00:03:25.789
but I'm generously giving
you twice as much time.

00:03:25.789 --> 00:03:27.207
Appreciate it.

00:03:27.999 --> 00:03:30.627
The high schoolers finish
this in three hours...

00:03:30.627 --> 00:03:32.921
If you take your time,
you'll get nothing done.

00:03:33.338 --> 00:03:36.841
Those of you who don't
finish in time will leave.

00:03:36.841 --> 00:03:37.842
That's all.

00:04:16.965 --> 00:04:19.300
I must seem super lame.

00:04:21.052 --> 00:04:23.221
Is this really the end?

00:04:23.638 --> 00:04:25.598
Is this really right?

00:04:25.598 --> 00:04:27.142
Of course it's not right.

00:04:28.059 --> 00:04:32.022
If I had another chance,
I'd never lose to Yushi.

00:04:32.397 --> 00:04:35.442
No one can stop my Big Bang.

00:04:36.109 --> 00:04:39.446
Yeah, I refuse to go home now.

00:04:39.446 --> 00:04:41.364
I can't leave before I
get to the good stuff.

00:04:41.656 --> 00:04:43.116
Fools!

00:04:46.911 --> 00:04:48.204
Accept it.

00:04:48.747 --> 00:04:51.374
We lost.

00:04:52.167 --> 00:04:53.376
He's right.

00:04:53.376 --> 00:04:56.046
We lost fair and square.

00:04:56.588 --> 00:04:59.716
It must have been difficult
for the winners, too.

00:05:02.844 --> 00:05:05.096
I know that,

00:05:05.972 --> 00:05:06.890
but I...

00:05:08.141 --> 00:05:09.184
What was that?

00:05:09.517 --> 00:05:13.104
Hey, is this the road we took here?

00:05:13.563 --> 00:05:14.647
What's going on?

00:05:15.565 --> 00:05:17.150
Where are we?

00:05:20.278 --> 00:05:21.613
Hey, driver.

00:05:21.613 --> 00:05:22.655
Where the hell are we?

00:05:22.947 --> 00:05:26.659
Excuse me, driver, but if you're lost,

00:05:26.659 --> 00:05:29.579
you should stop the bus
and take a look at a map.

00:05:31.456 --> 00:05:33.917
Hey! What's going on?

00:05:37.295 --> 00:05:40.298
Why are you dropping us off here?

00:05:40.298 --> 00:05:42.300
Where the heck are we, anyway?

00:05:43.468 --> 00:05:45.053
I've been waiting for you.

00:05:49.057 --> 00:05:50.767
Coach Saitoh.

00:05:50.767 --> 00:05:53.061
Echizen! What are you doing here?

00:05:53.311 --> 00:05:56.022
Echizen, what have you been up to?

00:05:56.022 --> 00:05:59.234
Kintaro-<i>san</i>, we've all been
so worried about you.

00:05:59.567 --> 00:06:01.027
Sorry, sorry.

00:06:01.027 --> 00:06:03.571
I went exploring with
Koshimae and got lost.

00:06:03.571 --> 00:06:04.656
Right?

00:06:04.656 --> 00:06:06.157
Something like that.

00:06:06.533 --> 00:06:10.328
My real job begins here.

00:06:10.704 --> 00:06:12.330
What are you talking about?

00:06:12.831 --> 00:06:14.499
Where are we?

00:06:15.083 --> 00:06:17.919
Didn't we drop out?

00:06:17.919 --> 00:06:19.337
Yes, you did.

00:06:19.337 --> 00:06:22.007
However, if you do not wish

00:06:22.007 --> 00:06:24.676
to widen the gap between
yourselves and the winners...

00:06:24.676 --> 00:06:27.429
...why don't you try
climbing this mountain?

00:06:29.514 --> 00:06:30.974
Climb the mountain?

00:06:31.307 --> 00:06:32.559
Hold on.

00:06:32.559 --> 00:06:34.519
Are you saying we have a chance to

00:06:34.519 --> 00:06:37.522
return to the camp if
we climb this mountain?

00:06:37.939 --> 00:06:39.941
You'll have to find out.

00:06:39.941 --> 00:06:41.401
Don't give us that crap.

00:06:41.943 --> 00:06:43.945
You're not giving us a straight answer.

00:06:43.945 --> 00:06:45.822
What are you trying to say?

00:06:47.782 --> 00:06:48.742
Echizen.

00:06:49.451 --> 00:06:51.411
Hold up, Koshimae.

00:06:51.411 --> 00:06:53.246
Don't run off by yourself.

00:06:57.667 --> 00:06:58.626
Damn it.

00:06:59.044 --> 00:07:01.379
We just have to climb it, right?

00:07:12.098 --> 00:07:13.892
What's up there?

00:07:14.267 --> 00:07:18.021
You guys were weaker than the winners.

00:07:18.521 --> 00:07:19.814
That's why you lost.

00:07:19.814 --> 00:07:21.358
That's not an answer.

00:07:21.858 --> 00:07:24.319
The winners have already

00:07:24.319 --> 00:07:27.947
begun training with a special regimen.

00:07:27.947 --> 00:07:30.658
The gap between you will
only become larger.

00:07:30.658 --> 00:07:34.245
Whether you decide to
try to close that gap...

00:07:34.579 --> 00:07:38.416
...or not... is up to you.

00:07:52.764 --> 00:07:54.057
Good luck.

00:08:00.397 --> 00:08:01.356
Bastard.

00:08:09.239 --> 00:08:10.407
We're going on ahead.

00:08:11.366 --> 00:08:13.410
Let's do this!

00:08:14.577 --> 00:08:16.329
Watch what you're doing!

00:08:16.329 --> 00:08:17.706
This isn't a race!

00:08:23.795 --> 00:08:24.462
Momo!

00:08:24.462 --> 00:08:26.047
Are you okay?

00:08:27.173 --> 00:08:29.259
Momo-<i>senpai</i>'s hands haven't healed yet.

00:08:30.552 --> 00:08:32.804
Momo, don't push yourself too hard.

00:08:32.804 --> 00:08:34.514
You should take a break.

00:08:35.056 --> 00:08:36.391
I'm fine.

00:08:36.391 --> 00:08:38.977
Don't worry about me.
You guys go on ahead.

00:08:39.227 --> 00:08:40.437
But...

00:08:40.437 --> 00:08:41.646
Please.

00:08:42.188 --> 00:08:46.067
I don't want to hold you back.

00:08:57.746 --> 00:08:58.913
Momo...

00:09:00.123 --> 00:09:03.084
You're giving up over
such a minor wound.

00:09:03.626 --> 00:09:04.502
What'd you say?

00:09:04.878 --> 00:09:06.671
Go home and wallow in regret.

00:09:07.088 --> 00:09:09.257
Bring it on, bastard!

00:09:09.257 --> 00:09:11.051
You wanna fight? Huh?

00:09:12.052 --> 00:09:14.763
Hey, knock it off, guys!

00:09:17.766 --> 00:09:19.392
Cut it out.

00:09:19.392 --> 00:09:20.352
Hey, Momo.

00:09:20.352 --> 00:09:23.104
There is no shame in
going home, Momoshiro.

00:09:23.938 --> 00:09:25.440
Sanada-<i>san</i>.

00:09:25.815 --> 00:09:27.901
We already lost once.

00:09:27.901 --> 00:09:31.863
Better to graciously accept defeat
than to struggle in vain.

00:09:32.655 --> 00:09:34.282
Do you think there's any point

00:09:34.282 --> 00:09:36.785
in climbing this mountain
when you're injured?

00:09:42.665 --> 00:09:43.667
Get on.

00:09:45.543 --> 00:09:46.628
Viper.

00:09:47.128 --> 00:09:49.756
We'll pick this up once
we reach the top.

00:09:49.756 --> 00:09:50.799
You...

00:09:50.799 --> 00:09:53.426
I'm telling you to climb on my back.

00:09:53.426 --> 00:09:55.428
Hurry up, moron.

00:09:55.428 --> 00:09:57.972
What are you talking about, you idiot?

00:09:58.264 --> 00:10:01.685
I'd rather drop out than
ride on your back.

00:10:01.685 --> 00:10:03.687
Don't you want to rise back up?

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:08.483
What good will worrying
about your pride do now?

00:10:09.401 --> 00:10:13.029
Work your way back up,
Takeshi Momoshiro!

00:10:14.489 --> 00:10:17.867
You're right. I...

00:10:22.497 --> 00:10:23.665
Thanks.

00:10:24.124 --> 00:10:26.918
If you can't carry me anymore,
you can leave me anytime.

00:10:26.918 --> 00:10:31.089
Of course. I don't want to
be dragged down with you.

00:10:32.924 --> 00:10:33.967
Wow.

00:10:58.241 --> 00:10:59.576
We're in luck.

00:10:59.909 --> 00:11:02.245
There don't seem to be any
steep slopes from here.

00:11:03.121 --> 00:11:06.166
You'll be able to walk on
your own legs, Momoshiro.

00:11:07.876 --> 00:11:08.918
Momoshiro?

00:11:10.003 --> 00:11:12.505
Hey, what's wrong, Momoshiro?

00:11:17.844 --> 00:11:21.348
Wake up, you bastard! Stop sleeping!

00:11:21.348 --> 00:11:24.809
Huh? Oh, sorry.
I didn't have anything to do.

00:11:24.809 --> 00:11:26.853
I'm gonna kill you!

00:11:29.356 --> 00:11:30.774
This is amazing!

00:11:32.108 --> 00:11:35.403
We must've climbed up pretty high.

00:11:37.197 --> 00:11:38.490
Wait.

00:11:39.991 --> 00:11:42.911
We're supposed to cross that?

00:11:45.997 --> 00:11:50.502
We'll have to cross the
bridge to get to the peak.

00:11:50.502 --> 00:11:51.878
Seriously?

00:11:52.629 --> 00:11:55.548
Don't get scared of one little bridge.

00:11:55.548 --> 00:11:57.801
I'm not scared.

00:11:58.176 --> 00:12:02.138
Is it safe for people to cross this?

00:12:02.138 --> 00:12:04.891
Of course it's safe.

00:12:04.891 --> 00:12:06.768
That's right. This'll be easy.

00:12:07.352 --> 00:12:09.145
Right, Koshimae?

00:12:09.813 --> 00:12:10.897
But...

00:12:15.151 --> 00:12:17.821
What're you looking at?

00:12:23.201 --> 00:12:26.329
Hey, don't get too close.

00:12:26.705 --> 00:12:29.499
Kei-<i>kun</i>, you're last.

00:12:29.499 --> 00:12:31.418
Be careful, everyone.

00:12:32.544 --> 00:12:35.255
Quit your crying.

00:12:35.588 --> 00:12:37.507
This bridge is no big deal.

00:12:38.550 --> 00:12:40.552
I'm through waiting.

00:12:46.182 --> 00:12:47.600
What's going on?

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:49.519
Kei-<i>kun</i>, don't cross yet.

00:12:59.571 --> 00:13:01.906
Is this bridge going to collapse?

00:13:01.906 --> 00:13:07.537
Maybe it's safe since it's
supporting all of us and Tanishi.

00:13:09.414 --> 00:13:12.751
Either way, we should consider
the bridge at its limit.

00:13:13.418 --> 00:13:16.171
If we add any more weight...

00:13:53.958 --> 00:13:55.835
Are you okay, Momo?

00:13:56.461 --> 00:13:59.047
A tree cushioned my fall. I'm fine.

00:13:59.464 --> 00:14:02.342
We're lucky we didn't fall in the river.

00:14:03.009 --> 00:14:04.344
Hey, Gakuto.

00:14:04.344 --> 00:14:08.264
You said we'd be fine,
but we're anything but fine.

00:14:08.640 --> 00:14:10.141
You're blaming me?

00:14:10.141 --> 00:14:12.560
Isn't it his fault for being so heavy?

00:14:12.560 --> 00:14:13.812
What was that?!

00:14:14.145 --> 00:14:16.022
Who cares?

00:14:16.022 --> 00:14:18.733
Everyone's fine, so it all worked out.

00:14:21.486 --> 00:14:24.155
I wonder what Yuu-<i>kun</i>'s doing right now?

00:14:33.206 --> 00:14:34.416
Yuu-<i>kun</i>...

00:14:39.504 --> 00:14:40.505
What was that?

00:14:40.505 --> 00:14:43.174
That wasn't a wolf, was it?

00:14:43.591 --> 00:14:44.759
Don't panic!

00:14:44.759 --> 00:14:46.094
Everyone grab a torch!

00:14:58.189 --> 00:15:00.108
A monkey? No, wait!

00:15:00.608 --> 00:15:01.943
It went that way!

00:15:01.943 --> 00:15:02.986
Surround it!

00:15:07.949 --> 00:15:09.868
Yuu-<i>kun</i>, is that you?

00:15:12.454 --> 00:15:14.831
Yuu-<i>kun</i>!

00:15:19.419 --> 00:15:21.129
Good work, everyone.

00:15:21.713 --> 00:15:24.716
What, it's you, Zaizen?

00:15:25.008 --> 00:15:26.217
What are you doing here?

00:15:26.885 --> 00:15:30.638
It's a long story.

00:15:34.351 --> 00:15:38.438
Why'd I have to come
up to these mountains?

00:15:38.438 --> 00:15:41.066
I turned down the training
camp invitation because

00:15:41.066 --> 00:15:42.233
it sounded like so much work.

00:15:42.942 --> 00:15:45.779
Aren't you worried about Koharu?

00:15:45.779 --> 00:15:49.074
I didn't think you were that cold.

00:15:49.074 --> 00:15:51.659
Koharu, wait for me!

00:15:52.202 --> 00:15:54.245
But, Yuuji-<i>senpai</i>,

00:15:54.245 --> 00:15:58.833
I get the feeling we've
been going in circles.

00:15:59.167 --> 00:16:01.169
Do you think we could be lost?

00:16:01.169 --> 00:16:03.338
We're just a little off the trail.

00:16:03.797 --> 00:16:07.884
In these situations, you just have
to use your natural instincts.

00:16:08.510 --> 00:16:11.179
Natural instincts, huh?

00:16:12.847 --> 00:16:16.142
So the result of using
his natural instincts...

00:16:16.142 --> 00:16:18.228
...is this.

00:16:22.107 --> 00:16:23.108
Yuu-<i>kun</i>...

00:16:25.443 --> 00:16:27.862
It's me. It's Koharu.

00:16:29.489 --> 00:16:30.990
Ko... ha...

00:16:30.990 --> 00:16:32.867
That's right! It's Koharu!

00:16:34.494 --> 00:16:36.496
Ko... ha... ru.

00:16:37.414 --> 00:16:38.373
Yuu-<i>kun</i>!

00:16:38.373 --> 00:16:39.624
Koharu!

00:16:40.625 --> 00:16:43.628
A beautiful story!
What a beautiful story!

00:16:43.628 --> 00:16:45.672
What's the point of this little skit?

00:16:47.674 --> 00:16:50.468
Anyway, according to Zaizen-<i>kun</i>,

00:16:50.468 --> 00:16:54.556
we'll have to climb this
cliff to get to the top.

00:16:54.973 --> 00:16:57.267
We have to climb this cliff, huh?

00:16:57.267 --> 00:16:58.560
This won't be easy.

00:16:59.185 --> 00:17:01.896
Isn't there a safer way to get up there?

00:17:01.896 --> 00:17:06.651
If we go back to the river,
we should be able to find one.

00:17:06.651 --> 00:17:11.489
I looked for alternate routes,
but I couldn't find any.

00:17:13.074 --> 00:17:15.785
Cowards who panic at
a little setback like this

00:17:15.785 --> 00:17:17.704
should just wait here for help.

00:17:17.704 --> 00:17:19.122
What was that?

00:17:19.122 --> 00:17:20.457
Hey.

00:17:20.457 --> 00:17:23.668
It won't be easy to scale
the cliff ahead of us.

00:17:24.461 --> 00:17:28.923
It would be prudent to preserve
what energy you can.

00:17:29.174 --> 00:17:30.467
Sanada...

00:17:31.384 --> 00:17:32.594
I know.

00:17:40.435 --> 00:17:42.479
That's enough, Kaidoh.

00:17:42.479 --> 00:17:45.190
Shut up. Don't move.

00:17:51.738 --> 00:17:53.823
Don't lose focus, Shishido!

00:17:53.823 --> 00:17:55.200
I know!

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:56.868
I know, but...

00:17:58.036 --> 00:17:59.245
Damn it.

00:17:59.245 --> 00:18:01.164
How did this happen?

00:18:01.164 --> 00:18:02.415
Shishido...

00:18:04.042 --> 00:18:06.419
We're being tested, aren't we?

00:18:08.046 --> 00:18:09.172
Damn it!

00:18:09.172 --> 00:18:12.967
I bet they're watching us from
somewhere and laughing!

00:18:14.511 --> 00:18:16.304
Let them laugh.

00:18:16.304 --> 00:18:17.806
It doesn't change anything.

00:18:24.729 --> 00:18:27.440
Echizen! Do you know?

00:18:29.192 --> 00:18:30.985
What's up there?

00:18:31.528 --> 00:18:34.531
What's waiting for us?

00:18:34.989 --> 00:18:36.116
Who knows?

00:18:36.866 --> 00:18:38.618
The only thing that's certain

00:18:39.244 --> 00:18:43.081
is climbing to the top
will make us stronger.

00:18:46.835 --> 00:18:48.503
To the top?

00:18:51.965 --> 00:18:52.841
What is that?

00:18:55.176 --> 00:18:57.137
Balls? Why?

00:19:01.391 --> 00:19:02.475
Watch out!

00:19:03.018 --> 00:19:04.185
What's happening?

00:19:05.937 --> 00:19:08.356
Momoshiro, are you okay?

00:19:08.356 --> 00:19:10.275
Don't worry about me.

00:19:10.275 --> 00:19:11.568
Worry about yourself.

00:19:13.236 --> 00:19:14.738
This is ridiculous!

00:19:14.988 --> 00:19:17.240
How much more do
you have to mock us

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:20.452
before you're satisfied, you bastards?

00:19:27.334 --> 00:19:28.335
Momoshiro!

00:19:29.085 --> 00:19:29.961
Momo!

00:19:30.462 --> 00:19:31.588
Momo-<i>senpai</i>!

00:19:31.588 --> 00:19:32.630
Momoshiro!

00:19:39.262 --> 00:19:41.139
Don't let go, Momoshiro!

00:19:42.140 --> 00:19:44.267
Sanada-<i>san</i>...

00:19:44.934 --> 00:19:45.977
Sanada-<i>san</i>...

00:19:46.978 --> 00:19:48.938
Listen up, guys!

00:19:49.230 --> 00:19:55.403
Up there... At the top of
this cliff, he's there!

00:19:55.403 --> 00:19:58.865
Someone who's mocking us who lost!

00:20:04.412 --> 00:20:07.248
This is our new battle.

00:20:07.248 --> 00:20:09.626
We'll stare back at those who mock us

00:20:09.626 --> 00:20:13.546
and beat the arrogance out of them.

00:20:14.381 --> 00:20:15.382
Don't back down.

00:20:15.715 --> 00:20:16.758
Don't be afraid.

00:20:17.050 --> 00:20:18.343
Don't look back.

00:20:18.718 --> 00:20:22.764
There's only one thing we must do now.

00:20:27.852 --> 00:20:28.937
Let's go!

00:20:29.479 --> 00:20:32.857
I don't know who you are,
but you just wait!

00:20:33.108 --> 00:20:35.360
Let's do this!

00:20:37.153 --> 00:20:38.405
Listen up!

00:20:38.405 --> 00:20:40.573
Leave no one behind!

00:20:40.573 --> 00:20:42.951
We'll all rise up together!

00:20:59.009 --> 00:21:00.593
We made it, Koshimae.

00:21:01.636 --> 00:21:02.637
Hey...

00:21:03.638 --> 00:21:06.099
What's going on over there?

00:21:15.775 --> 00:21:17.068
What is this?

00:21:17.068 --> 00:21:19.362
What's going on?

